    {"id":"n2t","type":"text","x":165,"y":200,"width":870,"height":75,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":9108,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":14,"fontFamily":1,"text":"【坑2】数值IK 求解失败(无解)\n🔍 诊断: 根因就是坑1 —— FK错→目标位姿在错误坐标系→不可达\n🟢 解决: FK修好后, 目标位姿正确, 数值IK自然收敛\n✅ 效果: 数值IK 往返误差 0.8mm, 成功率 49/50","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"【坑2】数值IK 求解失败(无解)\n🔍 诊断: 根因就是坑1 —— FK错→目标位姿在错误坐标系→不可达\n🟢 解决: FK修好后, 目标位姿正确, 数值IK自然收敛\n✅ 效果: 数值IK 往返误差 0.8mm, 成功率 49/50","lineHeight":1.3},

